{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> \u201cDesserted\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> is a chaotic co-op horror adventure for</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Up to 6 Players Online | Horror Co-op + Dark Humor + Cooking </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the edge of a god-forsaken universe, you and your crew pilot a <strong>Mobile Food Truck</strong>, scavenging through the ruins of lethal, derelict facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat, Excrete, and Generate Power to keep the systems humming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[When the lights go out, the menu changes... and you\u2019re the main course]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE CORE LOOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scavenge \u2192 Collect \u2192 Sizzle \u2192 Power Up \u2192 Blackout \u2192 Panic \u2192 Sacrifice \u2192 Repeat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/b6c0cea4c4956a9bb8efd7bb14c37a57.avif?t=1774154150\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/c01c4afc55af30a2ca84cb9ece9cdde3.poster.avif?t=1774154150\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/c01c4afc55af30a2ca84cb9ece9cdde3.webm?t=1774154150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/c01c4afc55af30a2ca84cb9ece9cdde3.mp4?t=1774154150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWERED BY\u2026 POOP \ud83d\udca9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional fuel sources are long  this universe, eating has become the only way to generate energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food you consume eventually becomes waste\u2026and that waste is transformed by the gods into usable power, keeping your food truck and surrounding facilities running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The grid fails when:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Equipment degradation\u3011</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Monster sabotage\u3011</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Random events\u3011</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Fuel depletion\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment the lights go out\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world stops being a kitchen, it transforms into a nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/490e620959ad4e713a499b674100e602.avif?t=1774154150\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/9e91bad5f73aa9d8a2433adb401dc29f.poster.avif?t=1774154150\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/9e91bad5f73aa9d8a2433adb401dc29f.webm?t=1774154150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/9e91bad5f73aa9d8a2433adb401dc29f.mp4?t=1774154150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Food truck is the heart of the team.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the <strong>raw ingredients and \u201cfood\u201d\u00a0</strong>found during the play back to the truck for centralized cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010High-calorie dishes can be converted into energy sources\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Used to:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Maintain electricity\u00a0\u3011</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Power essential systems\u3011</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Offer sacrifices to the gods\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TEAM SURVIVAL RULE #1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A.B.C Principle</strong><br><br><br><strong>Always Be Chewing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/217875b735fcb5ce89cf1a297174167f.avif?t=1774154150\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/7783502e1d789211de9c5269ba755c38.poster.avif?t=1774154150\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/7783502e1d789211de9c5269ba755c38.webm?t=1774154150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/7783502e1d789211de9c5269ba755c38.mp4?t=1774154150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monsters \u2014 Not Just Killers, they troll.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the universe is searching for food. Besides you and your friends, many unknown horrors are lurking out there. Even things that look like delicious food might turn into monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkins, potatoes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They will:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Vandalize your Food Truck\u3011</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Cut your power lines\u3011</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Steal your energy\u3011</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Watch you from the dark\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the time comes \u2014 they begin the hunt. \ud83e\ude78</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/503cad0e92bc98722fcba0ed3c11ad26.avif?t=1774154150\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/67b5c68e816747d682147e6819e5db23.poster.avif?t=1774154150\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/67b5c68e816747d682147e6819e5db23.webm?t=1774154150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/67b5c68e816747d682147e6819e5db23.mp4?t=1774154150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UP TO 6-PLAYER CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharing is caring, but resources are finite\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the <strong>Divine Offering</strong> must be paid in full, down to the last calorie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your team must:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010<strong>The Foragers</strong>\u3011Scouring the ruins for anything edible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010<strong>The Mechanics</strong>\u3011Keeping the power grid keep running.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010<strong>The Chefs</strong>\u3011Turning everything into &quot;food.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010<strong>The Bait</strong>\u3011<strong>\u00a0</strong>(Usually the guy who ate the most).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or, you could just eat everything yourself. We won't judge (but the Gods might).</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/7191d9d4646851149b26b1078e1c0737.avif?t=1774154150\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Procedural Generation</strong>.\u00a0Every expedition offers new layouts, lethal traps, and &quot;unplanned&quot; anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Themed Nightmare Zones:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Casino Hotel\u3011</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Cyber City\u3011</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Sci-Fi Laboratory\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area features unique:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Supports 6-Player Online Co-op</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>Add to your Steam Wishlist and check for the latest updates</strong></i></u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageb