=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Themed Nightmare Zones:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Casino Hotel\u3011</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Cyber City\u3011</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Sci-Fi Laboratory\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area features unique:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Supports 6-Player Online Co-op</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>Add to your Steam Wishlist and check for the latest updates</strong></i></u></p>","developers":["Prefabot Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/d456765f189cb30d81ec0b9e7af7b2f0d24aded1/header.jpg?t=1774154150","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3952820/1317634723/cbbeff4194a8392878a0985cef55f4581757b776/1756082591/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756408717","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3952820/1317634723/cbbeff4194a8392878a0985cef55f4581757b776/1756082591/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756408717","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3952820/1317634723/cbbeff4194a8392878a0985ce